  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a small bowl, mix together lemon juice, olive oil, smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add the fish fillets to the marinade and coat evenly.",
    "4. Thread the marinated fish onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "5. Grill the fish kebabs for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "6. Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot."
